Prefix(owl:=<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>)
Prefix(rdfs:=<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>)
Ontology(<http://example.org/root3> <http://example.org/root3/v1>
Import(<http://example.org/imp2>)
